<title>NEW ZEALAND: Shell NZ joins others in cutting petrol price.</title>
<headline>Shell NZ joins others in cutting petrol price.</headline>
<dateline>VWELLINGTON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shell New Zealand Ltd said on Thursday it would decrease petrol prices by one cent per litre and diesel by two cents per litre from midnight, matching falls announced by other oil companies.</p>
<p>Shell said the cuts were in response to a downward trend in crude oil prices and to remain competitive.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
